{{!
    @template theme_pslanguagehub/brandmark

    The small brand mark used in the navigation bar and the footer.

    Two letters on the signature gradient rather than the full logo: at 38px
    the drawing inside the logo is mud, and this is a tile of CSS instead of an
    image request. The full mark is kept for the login page, where it is large
    enough to read.

    Marked aria-hidden because it always sits beside the name in text - a
    screen reader would otherwise announce the brand twice.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * none

    Example context (json):
    {}
}}
<span class="ps-mark" aria-hidden="true">PS</span>
